    "- Established in 1989 - 47 Medical departments, 47 Specialized centers - AMC is Korea’s largest medical institution with 2,700 beds, and 67 operating rooms, with 1,700 physicians and surgeons, 3,500 nurses. A typical day at AMC sees 2,500 inpatients and 1": 1,
    "≫Established on 15th of April, 1971 ≫Manage 25 medical departments and 16 specialized centers Chosun University Hospital take leading role about serious illness treatment in each area with personalized tailored treatment and efficient treatment system. Currently, 849beds, 15operation rooms, 303 physicians, 720 nurses, 20 Pharmacist, 122 Medical Technicians, 193 Administration work together. Average hospitalization patient number is about 700, Outpatient is about 2000. ≫Acquired 1st class treatment hospital and keep maintaining until now (Colorectal cancer, breast cancer, gastric cancer, lung cancer, hip joint, liver cancer, brain stroke) ≫Our hospital implemented high-risk operation about 13,000 times per year average. We are on progress of Watson for Oncology, which is artificial intelligence and selected by government as regional infectious disease specialized hospital, dementia center, cancer center and non-smoking helping center. -Community accompanied hospital 1. Sewol Ferry Disaster emergency medical support 2. Jang-Seong medical care hospital fire accident medical support 3. MERS specialized hospital 4. International sports event 5. Smart emergency medical direction - Abroad Disaster Medical Support 1. Role of public medical response hospital 2. Status of Chosun University Hospital Medical Support Team activities - Government selected medical business in our hospital 1. Regional emergency medical center 2. Homan regional rehabilitation center 3. Gwangju Non-Smoking helping center 4. Gwangju dementia center 5. Regional infectious disease specialized hospital 6. Gwangju province cancer center (Preparing) and 18 government business": 1,
    "KYUNG HEE UNIVERSITY HEALTHCARE SYSTEM was opened in October 5th 1971, as complex of Medical, Dental and Korean healthcare system. Also a top-notch medical facilities consisting of Gangdong Kyung Hee University Hospital(opened June 12th, 2006). Main identity of creation Kyung Hee University is to learn “Cultural creation of the world” in a hall of the peace, in 1965 we launched a broad area of Medicine which are medical, dental, oriental, fermiology and nursing. “The creation of healthcare future of hospital through the communication and convergence.” Kyung Hee university Medical Center declared a new vision of 21st century sciences about practicing humanity and philanthropy, the body and mind, human civilization. Humanity and the Earth will continue opening a healthy and peaceful global community to achieve harmony and balance. [Mission] -. Leading the future of life sciences as a creative challenge, contributing to the promotion of human health. [Vision] -. Hospitals that create the future of medical care through communication and convergence": 1,
    "When the Samsung Medical Center opened in 1994, it changed the paradigm of the domestic medical field with the innovative concepts of a “patient-centered” and “customer satisfaction.” During the past 20 years, the Samsung Medical Center has received much love and encouragement and has won the first place 14 times in the National Customer Satisfaction Index (NCSI), first place 16 times in the Korean Customer Satisfaction Index (KCSI), first place 12 times in the Korean Standard - Service Quality Index (KS-SQI) consecutively, and has been selected as the top medical center 12 times consecutively in the hospital sector in Brand Star. In addition, the hospital proclaimed the slogan of “Vision 2020, Happiness through Healthcare Innovation” in 2012 and has made progress to become a leading hospital worldwide. The Samsung Medical Center proceeds to achieve medical innovation in the future to promote the happiness of patients, to develop into a global hub for the medical research, and to play a leading role in linking the industry-University-Hospital. The Samsung Medical Center will also create the image of a new future hospital as a public medical institution that leads social contribution.": 1,
    "Seoul National University Bundang Hospital (SNUBH) has been committed to providing top-notch medical care to the patients we serve. Throughout the years, we have committed all our resources to improving the quality of patient care, pioneering research activities and also the education of future health care professionals. SNUBH has been consistently ranked first in the category of quality measurements of general hospitals for thirteen consecutive years and Korea Brand Power Index. In 2012, SNUBH was given the title of “1st Class in all categories” of quality measurements based on outcomes, patient safety, and customer satisfaction, the recognition from the Health Insurance Review and Assessment Service, which is a subsidiary of the National Insurance company of Korea. World-Class Patient Care Our 1,360-bed medical center, located at the Southern suburb of Seoul, offers sophisticated cutting edge diagnostic and therapeutic care in virtually every specialty and subspecialty of medicine and surgery. Our multidisciplinary specialty care centers, comprising of SNUBH medical staff from all different lines of specialties provide comprehensive one stop medi- cal care to the patients with various medical conditions and different medical needs. Bringing cutting edge technology and traditional humanity together, the quality of our medical care has been consistently proved to be of the highest class in this country, based on all of the quality measurement criteria. Setting the Bar for Quality & Safety SNUBH was the first hospital in Korea to be fully digitalized and paperless, supported by the new EMR (Electronic Medi- cal Record) System developed by our subsidiary medical information technology company. The application of the CPOE (computer physician order entry) system, the first in Korea, was the leap frog event to improving quality of patient care and decrease medical errors in hospital care. As for our commitment to improve daily care of our patients and progression of medical science, we continue to measure our performance according to the scientific criteria in the area of patient care and research. With regular organizational activities for continuous quality improvements, the industries’ best practices are developed in this campus.": 1,
    "Seoul National University Hospital is the tertiary hospital that has been leading medical advancement of the Republic of Korea for the past 130 years. We are at the forefront of improving not only the nation’s healthcare but also global medicine through its network of following hospitals: SNU Bundang Hospital, SMG-SNU Boramae Medical Center, SNUH Healthcare System Gangnam Center, and Sheikh Khalifa Specialty Hospital (SKSH), located in the United Arab Emirates (UAE). SNUH will continuously provide world-class medical service to patients by enhancing the patient-care system and working towards maintaining a comfortable facility environment. We will contribute ever more to be a hospital that helps patients return to their healthy life through endless research, education, and care.": 1,
    "- Seoul St. Mary’s Hospital is a representative medical institution of Catholic Medical Center (CMC), which is the largest medical network consisting of 8 subsidiary hospitals and 29 research centers in Korea based on its 80 years of history. - Kangnam St": 1,
